# ── Google Drive Integration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# To enable "Save to Google Drive" on processed files:
#
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project (or use an existing one)
# 3. Go to "APIs & Services" → "Enable APIs" → enable "Google Drive API"
# 4. Go to "APIs & Services" → "Credentials" → "Create Credentials" → "OAuth 2.0 Client ID"
# 5. Choose "Web application"
# 6. Under "Authorized JavaScript origins" add:
#      http://localhost:5173
#      http://localhost:5174
#      https://your-vercel-app.vercel.app   ← add this when deployed
# 7. Copy the Client ID and paste it below
# 8. Rename this file to .env.local (git ignores it automatically)
#
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
